name: Link Analysis insider threat showcase
tagline: "A seeded insider-threat Link Analysis demo - a leaver's bulk reads and mail to a personal domain, access creep granted by one manager and two employees approving each other's expenses, planted among 3 000 invented employees with benign look-alikes"
description: "The security, HR and internal-investigations insider-threat Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier. Six synthetic feeds (employee, access_grant, access_daily, email_external, expense, vendor_change; 12 months landed from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged; 3 000 invented employees known by id only, about 12 200 access grants, 106 000 DAILY read counts per employee and system - never record-level - 29 000 days of external mail aggregated per employee and domain, 18 000 expense claims and 570 vendor master changes) are landed by six Collectors and Pipelines. The insider_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of six link kinds; the insider_screen_links Job derives the three insider-risk screens the saved views read. Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-insider-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by InsiderLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-insider-data.test.mjs): a customer account specialist who gives notice, then reads about 20 times their normal customer records for three weeks and mails 1.2 GB to a personal domain; an operations manager (EMP-0007) who grants payroll and treasury access to 4 of their reports with no ticket, one of whom then changes a vendor's bank details; two account managers who approve each other's expenses 40 times, just under the 500 limit, mostly at weekends. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a migration engineer's ticketed bulk read, an employee moved into payroll and granted access with a ticket, and a sales team lead approving a busy field team. Three saved views. Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only: every person, system, vendor and mail domain is invented."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:identification
contents[5]: "6 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months landed, 1 month staged)", "insider_links Job + Dataset (6 link kinds, via) and the insider_screen_links Dataset of three insider-risk screens", "3 saved views (leaver exfiltration, access creep, mutual approvals)", "3 planted stories with benign look-alikes", "Ground truth and golden tests in the repository"
